      "id": "out-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 476,
      "width": 678.6,
      "height": 48.75,
      "text": "No build tree, no CMake, nothing installed beyond the toolchain that was already there.\nThe plugin does not link against LLVM. Its symbols are already inside opt, and they get\nresolved when opt opens the file, which is why this is seconds rather than an hour.",
      "originalText": "No build tree, no CMake, nothing installed beyond the toolchain that was already there.\nThe plugin does not link against LLVM. Its symbols are already inside opt, and they get\nresolved when opt opens the file, which is why this is seconds rather than an hour.",
